Adopt native Codex daemons

Install complete Codex release packages matching the local CLI so native
package discovery and bundled tools keep working. Pin development tests
to Codex 0.163.

Use the native daemon's Unix socket and lifecycle management, restore
activated pods on startup, and keep shell access available when daemon
restoration fails.

Preserve pod-owned credentials and permission settings across
reconnects, including after host logout. Snapshot live conversation
